t. Surrounded by drifting debris caused by a strange anomaly, harvest it into raw materials to help you survive. Explore and discover the remains of our civilization. Find out what happened and why Earth evolved to a place where we lost control of our previous position at the top. Discover secrets of our past.", "summary": "Forever Skies is a first-person action survival game. Return to Earth destroyed by an ecological disaster, fly a high-tech airship, expand, rebuild and repair it. Scavenge resources to survive, face the dangers of the surface as you will hunt for viral pathogens to cure a mysterious illness.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/forever-skies", "videos": [{"id": 67181, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "vqy5noRNVJo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vqy5noRNVJo", "title": "Forever Skies Reveal Teaser Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vqy5noRNVJo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 67182, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "jlSYf0M-1Lc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jlSYf0M-1Lc", "title": "Forever Skies Extended Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jlSYf0M-1Lc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 71073, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "k6xvaromGe0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k6xvaromGe0", "title": "Forever Skies - Exploring Ruined Skies Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/k6xvaromGe0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 133725, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "H1ErLRz8xTU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H1ErLRz8xTU", "title": "Forever Skies | Survive - Build - Scavenge Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/H1ErLRz8xTU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 143558, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "OFDDMOEc_rk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OFDDMOEc_rk", "title": "Forever Skies - Release Date + Preorder Trailer | PS5 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/v